      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Related: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/moderation-tools-for-world-creators\nI agree that we need better moderation tools, but\n> To make a apt metaphor , If someone walks into your home and shoots you \nI think it would be easier to convey your position if you phrased your concerns differently. It makes it difficult to discuss what you said.",
