      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "EXCELLENT!  I can't believe there isn't more outrage about the LACK of moderation options for world owners and even instance owners, or host tools for events.  You simply can't stop them even with very complex scripted security options.  It's about TIME something is done, and simply slapping an anti-cheat has not stopped the horrific hateful people from being extremely harassing and disruptive to people who are actually trying to do something good in VRChat, which simply makes VRChat look like a joke.  I can't believe so few people have \"voted\" on this but this shouldn't even be something to be voted on... this needs IMMEDIATE RESOLUTION.  It's simply ridiculous that it hasn't been addressed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
