      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I upvote this suggestion. Creators are crafting worlds for users to enjoy and to have someone come in and just create chaos with hateful remarks and trying to destroy and crash the world makes no sense. Any effort that could remedy the situation including allowing a world creator to ban problematic users, I wholeheartedly support.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "63ea9e9b1dada75863ce5f6b",
      "author": {
        "_id": "62393928546a41082c280c5b",
        "alias": "Dual Emu",
        "aliasID": "65c2b5a8ed6eefce4c040f3d",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny-assets.io/images/ffe3c6e4942cff51a135ff6fcb71babe.png",
        "created": "2022-03-22T02:49:12.166Z",
